  "section": "3.29",
  "rulesText": "This section presents the Warlock spell list. The spells are organized by spell level and then alphabetized, and each spell's school of magic is listed. In the Special column, C means the spell requires Concentration, R means it's a Ritual, and M means it requires a specific Material component.\n\nCantrips (Level 0 Warlock Spells)\n\nLevel 1 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 2 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 3 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 4 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 5 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 6 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 7 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 8 Warlock Spells\n\nLevel 9 Warlock Spells",
